**Decision and rationale**: Regression is at participant level, so sample replicates must be collapsed before joining clinical data. Missing/non-numeric entries become NA and are handled by complete-case omission per metabolite. No global normalization or imputation was imposed because the task does not specify one and abundances are already quantified. The metabolite row index is retained so duplicate annotations remain separate tests.

